Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to\Nget help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest\Ndreams. So stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,tall reach out your hand cut through the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,wind and make a stand\Ndon't let the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,win just break through we'll do it our way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the best that we know\Nwith tears and doubts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and tone we'll go where we all want to go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the page within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The armory is in the lowest\Nlevel of the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can slow the island down even a\Nlittle bit, it might make all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No one said this was going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some persistence, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is far from over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the limit of your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep creating flame clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cloud can do it, then you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it better!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,More more no harm will come to the\NFlower Capital, not under my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,i know you wouldn't challenge an emperor\Nunprepared what have you caught your trump
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,card have you managed to awaken your power\Nbecause that would be a damn good start
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm still working on it\Nright now it takes up a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,of my stamina so i need to\Nsave it Hold on my last leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I used it too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same thing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're not making\Nany headway like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool do\Nyou take me for, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I forgot about the\Narmory you've been tolted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything you're\Nhiding down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All those weapons I manufactured,\Nall those explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the biggest\Nbang in the history of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our final scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it all to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't suffer your\Nidiocy a moment longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Shuriken! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic earlobe-crackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Offending one's ward is\Nnever pathetic, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Such sentimental nonsense\Nwill be the death of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to make our exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Kashima will be blown to pieces,\Nand the pirates along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them to their meaningless squabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them all burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You little delinquents\Nhave been very naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So take your punishment\Nand don't talk back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek-a-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I got the noisy one at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These two have been holding\Noff Big Mom all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be incredibly strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna take your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,K. Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Better brace yourselves, 'cause\Nthis one's gonna be painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to show you\Nwhat real pain feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room's incision is harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, it's true power comes\Nfrom the shock wave it generates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shock wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You cocky little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful what you wish for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Us dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I sticking to your head, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll suddenly turn a lady into a magnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do you know such a nasty trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't even gotten\Nto the good point yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to the Steel Beats?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The villains are gonna come down! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Trafalgar, release it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Atroar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They buried her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, she's gotta be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone can survive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my best trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat metal, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that's payback for what you put me through
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.10,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so your awakened power magnetizes things
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,big mom included
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that was nice work but\Nhow long does it last for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,just because we worked together once\Ndoesn't mean you get to learn all my secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Life or Oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's using Soul Pucci on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got the soup she wants, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We kinda smelled it all earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't give her soup,\Nshe'll steal our life force away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even throw in a year's\Nworth of my own lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fury-given form, the only way\Nto make myself even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's growing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, on the bright side,\Nshe's a much bigger target now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cut through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't send her flying either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too damn big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She was huge already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even fight this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.86,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fire's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gotten completely\Nout of hand. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This floor is a living nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really outdone yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since\NI've felt pain like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Decades, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, I respect your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law, Captain Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like Straw\NHat Luffy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You young upstarts all\Nthink you can push me aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't be replaced so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you know some of us are\Njust trying to study history
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,shouldn't have to fight\Nmonsters just to learn a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,thing or two quit your damn\Ncomplaining as long as we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,live we have to fight i'll\Nknock her on that throne
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it kills me you want\Nto be an emperor that badly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but you'll have to wrest the\Ntitle from my A cold, dead body!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are lots of guards ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head to the cave\Nchamber and take a side path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make even more enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were never allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Scraps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Apoo, but the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how your attacks work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling your bluff there, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At first I thought they\Ndidn't have a vector,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I watched closely\Nand I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They fire when your target hears you,\NAnd you aim them with your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are trade secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, whatever you got\Nme But you're still screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's no way you're taking\Ndown three numbers on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an obligation to\NStraw Hat in this crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My honor demands that\NI beat you here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Drake and Appu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are you doing in the back rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You partying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at you, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you busting down walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing down the house is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were on\Nthe roof fighting Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get to the armory right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato doesn't know he's\Na traitor yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Drake is\Nuseless to me either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, new plan, Drake. I need to\Nget past. One sec, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I got good news. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me Sorry,\Nbut it'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a big hurry right\Nnow And besides that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I aren't on the same team anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally cut all ties with Kaido. I dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even better, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play games with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have time to fight\None of the Toby Ropo either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better get out of my\Nway. Wait, Yamato. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited long enough already. Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to pick\Na fight with me, Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the same side!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut ties with the Beast\NPirates just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I hope you don't hold\Nit against me when I do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save Onigashima and\Nthe Flower Capital! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good help really is hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get Yamato on my side, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?! Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you, man! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody screwing me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Ndrinking, you two! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You might take it out of this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, I'm poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Baron Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll stay here and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep Niko Robin safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll go, but be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not so helpless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard what they said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why we must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow their\Nsacrifice to be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're defeating\Nthe Mink Warriors so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever those men are,\Nthey're terribly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,CP0.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a Cipher Pol unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw them before, back in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're government officers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Intelligence agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are they looking\Nfor you at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say, but we're\Nfacing the worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is apparent, at least. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,CP0 is the top-ranked unit\Nin all of Cipher Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And the masked agents are the\Nmost dangerous, even amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that our escape\Noptions are a little bare-bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, come on, let's\Nget you to somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Choo-ji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chobro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Judge used to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I have nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a geisha from the Capitol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to create the\Nperfect soldier. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With incredible strength\Nand a heart of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful and merciless. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you're not excited to show\Noff that germ of blood in your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like them, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm human!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, miss? Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Osume, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, are you alright? Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack this poor girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never... Excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting on the\Nside of Wano, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're doing this to your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I just showed up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't lay a finger on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so innocent, why did she run?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now leave before someone finds this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters who beat up innocent\Ngirls are not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear this wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever show your face here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never lay a hand on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, German boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What you doing over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, but\Nthe pleasure hall's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never hurt a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.36,0:24:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They beat a woman unconscious. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys represent goes\Nagainst my principles
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you're telling me i'm gonna end up like\Nthem yeah my body isn't tingling anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.70,0:24:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe it already happened\Ni was caught up in my
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,thoughts when i ran into\Nthat girl in the hallway
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it took me a second to notice her and\Nthen she went flying and she was bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked at me with fear in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.74,0:24:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.42,0:24:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man do you want on your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,An unreliable dreamer like me,\Nwho's afraid of his own power,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.94,0:24:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,who's helpless every\Ntime he faces a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a warrior of science who can beat up a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.42,0:25:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,monster like this\Nwithout a second thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who has a heart of ice and a\Nwill of steel that never fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would be more useful\Nto the King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you on my crew, Saadji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what'll happen\Nfrom here on out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the German suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.24,0:25:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna wear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.00,0:25:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When I put this suit on, it awakened a power\Nthat's been inside me since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.96,0:25:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you finally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, suit up, Germa boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.56,0:25:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I can do is put\Nan end to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you on my crew, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.86,0:26:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.50,0:26:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.54,0:26:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choosing my own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.84,0:26:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I SAID PUT IT ON, NOT DESTROY IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Jeremiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, women's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish this\Nfight, on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.46,0:26:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.66,0:26:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So when do I have this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's calling me at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.64,0:27:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you might be\Ndying in a ditch somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.98,0:27:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So I snuck that snail on\Nyou as a safety precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.28,0:27:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dying, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.70,0:27:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.60,0:27:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're beating the beast\Npirates no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.66,0:27:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.28,0:27:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a chance I might not\Nbe in my right mind anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, then kill me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.56,0:28:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, just like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what your problem is, but at\Nleast I got something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.48,0:28:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you dare die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.66,0:28:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Galick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You got invisibility tech?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.76,0:28:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet Daddy gave you that too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you adding fuel to the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm already burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell's memories!
